# Line-ending policy.
#
# Every text file in this repository is stored and checked out with LF. Without
# this, a Windows clone with `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites the whole working
# tree to CRLF on checkout, which is why `git diff --check` used to print a
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" advisory for every file it looked at. The
# working tree already matches this policy, so declaring it changes no content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows launchers are the exception: cmd.exe needs CRLF to run them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
